        "question_type": "single_choice",
        "question_title": "If \\(\\theta\\) is acute and \\(\\tan\\theta+\\cot\\theta=4\\), then the value of \\(\\sin^{4}\\theta+\\cos^{4}\\theta\\) is",
        "question_instruction": "Choose one correct option.",
        "explanation": "Since \\(\\tan\\theta+\\cot\\theta=\\frac{1}{\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta}=4\\), we get \\(\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta=\\frac{1}{4}\\). Hence \\(\\sin^{4}\\theta+\\cos^{4}\\theta=(\\sin^{2}\\theta+\\cos^{2}\\theta)^2-2\\sin^{2}\\theta\\cos^{2}\\theta=1-\\frac{1}{8}=\\frac{7}{8}\\).",
        "question_audio": null,
        "time_limit_seconds": 30,
        "points": 10,
        "sort_order": 21,
        "question_data": {
